  (@custom "contractspecv0" (after data) "\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\04name\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\01\00\00\00\10\00\00\00\00\00\00\00<Pause both PT and the paired YT. Requires the `PAUSER` role.\00\00\00\05pause\00\00\00\00\00\00\01\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\06caller\00\00\00\00\00\13\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\1dReturn the paired YT address.\00\00\00\00\00\00\06get_yt\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\01\00\00\00\13\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\13Return pause state.\00\00\00\00\06paused\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\01\00\00\00\01\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\81Redeem PT shares for underlying. Burns PT from `owner`, burns YT pre-expiry,\0aunwraps IBT, and transfers underlying to `receiver`.\00\00\00\00\00\00\06redeem\00\00\00\00\00\04\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\06caller\00\00\00\00\00\13\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\06shares\00\00\00\00\00\0b\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\08receiver\00\00\00\13\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\05owner\00\00\00\00\00\00\13\00\00\00\01\00\00\00\0b\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\06symbol\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\01\00\00\00\10\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\07approve\00\00\00\00\04\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\05owner\00\00\00\00\00\00\13\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\07spender\00\00\00\00\13\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\06amount\00\00\00\00\00\0b\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\11live_until_ledger\00\00\00\00\00\00\04\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\07balance\00\00\00\00\01\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\07account\00\00\00\00\13\00\00\00\01\00\00\00\0b\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\8eDeposit underlying assets. PT pulls from `caller`, wraps to IBT, mints PT\0ato `pt_receiver` and YT to `yt_receiver` after the tokenization fee.\00\00\00\00\00\07deposit\00\00\00\00\04\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\06caller\00\00\00\00\00\13\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\06assets\00\00\00\00\00\0b\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\0bpt_receiver\00\00\00\00\13\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\0byt_receiver\00\00\00\00\13\00\00\00\01\00\00\00\0b\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\1dReturn the IBT vault address.\00\00\00\00\00\00\07get_ibt\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\01\00\00\00\13\00\00\00\00\00\00\00>Un